WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.590 --> 00:00:05.443
The Mole had been working very hard all the morning, spring-cleaning his little home.

2
00:00:05.670 --> 00:00:12.081
First with brooms, then with dusters; then on ladders and steps and chairs, with a brush and a pail of

3
00:00:12.091 --> 00:00:18.703
whitewash; till he had dust in his throat and eyes, and splashes of whitewash all over his black fur,

4
00:00:18.730 --> 00:00:21.009
and an aching back and weary arms.

5
00:00:21.170 --> 00:00:25.574
Spring was moving in the air above and in the earth below and around him,

6
00:00:25.713 --> 00:00:31.745
penetrating even his dark and lowly little house with its spirit of divine discontent and longing.
